{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Low-level battleground players are lifted to their bracket top while inside",
  "contract": "A level 12 Human Warrior and a level 12 Human class 12 who enter a Warsong Gulch of the 10-29 bracket get a health-only lift: the difference between the level 29 and level 12 rows of player_class_stats and player_race_stats in base health and Stamina, and nothing else. Warrior Stamina +22 and maximum health +459 (base health +239, 22 Stamina x 10); class 12 Stamina +14 and maximum health +394 (base health +254, 14 Stamina x 10). Strength, Agility, Intellect, Spirit and mana are not lifted and are not asserted here; the output scaling scenario checks that they stay put. A level 29 Orc Warrior gets nothing; a second one completes the faction pairing for the class 12 player. Leveling to 13 inside recomputes the lift instead of stacking it and keeps the Warrior at its full lifted maximum health. Leaving through the leave packet or by teleport removes the lift and clamps health to the restored maximum.",
